SHORT: 

This small util is very usefull since current DreamToss have no DpeCheck 
option. It'll scan conference/message base for duplicate messages and
delete all messages which fave identical FROM/TO/SUBJECT/CREATION fields
and identical message size.


USAGE:

DelDUp CONF/N/A,BASE/N,NODEL=TEST/S,DEBUG/S,BASENAME=BN/K

 Where :
 CONF = Conference number to process. You MUST suply this argument
 BASE = Optional Base number. If not suplied, all bases in conference will
        be checked.
 NODEL
 TEST = Only check base(s) and report, but do not delete any single message
 
 [DEBUG is for testing purpose only, and BASENAME is not supported, jet]
 
 Example:
 
  DelDup 5                  - Will check all messages in all bases in
                              5-th conference and delete all dupes.
  DelDup 6 TEST             - Will scan conference 6 and report duplicate
                              messages, but it'll not delete any dupe.
  DelDup 3 5 TEST           - Will scan msg base 5 in conference 3 for dupes
                              but it'll not delete any message.
  DelDup 4 71               - Will delete all duplicate messages in msg.base 
                              71 in conference 4.


